ATTDEF / ATTRIB's AcDbText defaults and 73 74 280, SEQEND's -2 (its
header); per product (*ENTGET-TYPE-LAYOUT-BY-PRODUCT* /
*ENTGET-TYPE-DEFAULTS-BY-PRODUCT*): SOLID / TRACE 39 (AutoCAD), POLYLINE's
210 place, VERTEX 91 (AutoCAD), MTEXT 72 (5 / 1) and 75 (BricsCAD), SPLINE
tolerances (1e-9 / 1e-10 AutoCAD, 1e-7 BricsCAD), the attribute's first 280
(AutoCAD). A 2D VERTEX no longer stores 71-74. Every measured family now
matches both products, except MTEXT 42 / 43 (the text's measured extents,
